⊕meta⊕
name = "chain-event-final"
description = "Event-chain tail. Triggered automatically by chaintest.pong (only when enabled). Logs the second-hop payload stage to close the cascade."
trigger.sky_event.event = "chaintest.pong"
output_style = "terse"
⊕⊕

※land※
Bash root node. Appends the final marker with the received payload stage.
※※

§land§
bash = "echo \"event-final:land stage=${SKY_PAYLOAD_STAGE:-none} $(date -u +%s)\" >> /tmp/skyway-chain-test.log"
§§

※※
chain-event-final: event-chain tail

Pure bash, zero cost. Auto-fires on chaintest.pong only when enabled. Its marker
in /tmp/skyway-chain-test.log is the proof the two-hop event cascade completed.
※※
